            "analysis": "Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: website-skeleton\nVersion: 3.0.0\n\nThe bundle is a highly sophisticated and professionally structured full-stack website generator for EdgeOne Pages. It implements robust security best practices, including RS256 JWT authentication with refresh token rotation, multi-tenant data isolation using mandatory tenant placeholders in D1 SQL queries, and secure payment callback handling with signature verification and idempotency locks. The code includes comprehensive middleware for RBAC, rate limiting, and CSP header injection, as well as audit logging for administrative actions. No evidence of malicious intent, data exfiltration, or unauthorized execution was found; the bundle is clearly designed as a secure, production-ready boilerplate for e-commerce and SaaS applications.",
